Location/Check/NotALocation: Check the location: the field location names a tiddler that is not a location
Location/Check/OwnerAndLocation: Check the location: an artifact has an owner or a location, not both; whoever had it before goes to former
Location/Check/PersonTwice: Check the location: a person has one location; someone who moves around gets the surrounding region
Location/Check/SpotAndLocation: Check the location: it is a spot of another location and has a field location
Location/Check/SpotTwice: Check the location: it is a spot of several locations
